  "id": "scheduled-drug",
  "term": "scheduled drug",
  "definition": "A scheduled drug is a psychotropic substance whose use is controlled by law. In the source, these drugs can be used medically only under restricted conditions and usually on a case-by-case basis when standard treatment has not worked and there is some evidence the drug may help the condition.",
